<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>A Little Something For You 💌</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top, #fff7f9 0%, #f8dfe7 45%, #e8b8c8 100%);
            color: #4b3039;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 720px;
        }

        .password-box,
        .letter-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(80, 35, 50, 0.18);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .heart {
            font-size: 45px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #80606a;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .clue {
            background: #fff1f5;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 320px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border: 2px solid #e4b5c3;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 17px;
            text-align: center;
            outline: none;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #b96f87;
        }

        button {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 13px 28px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #a95773;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            background: #91445f;
        }

        #error {
            color: #b33b56;
            margin-top: 15px;
            display: none;
        }

        .letter-box {
            display: none;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .letter-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .letter {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            white-space: pre-line;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 35px;
            text-align: right;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .music {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 18px;
            background: #fff1f5;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .music-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .music a {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #a95773;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
        }

        .small {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94717b;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .password-box,
            .letter-box {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }

            .letter {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- PASSWORD SCREEN -->
    <div class="password-box" id="passwordScreen">

        <div class="heart">💌</div>

        <h1>A Little Something For You</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Some words are meant for only one person.
        </p>

        <div class="clue">
            🔐 <strong>Clue</strong><br><br>
            the day I gave u a cake<br>
            <em>(mm/dd/yr)</em>
        </div>

        <input
            type="password"
            id="password"
            placeholder="Enter password"
            onkeydown="if(event.key === 'Enter') unlockLetter()"
        >

        <br>

        <button onclick="unlockLetter()">
            OPEN MY LETTER ♡
        </button>

        <p id="error">
            Hmm... that's not it. Try again. 💭
        </p>

    </div>


    <!-- LETTER -->
    <div class="letter-box" id="letterScreen">

        <div class="letter-title">
            For You, Micah 🤍
        </div>

        <div class="music">
            <div class="music-title">
                🎵 Paalala — Twosday
            </div>

            <a
                href="https://open.spotify.com/search/Paalala%20Twosday"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
                🎧 Play the song
            </a>

            <div class="small">
                Open the song and come back to read the letter. ♡
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="letter">

To my fave hooman, my all-time fave ragebait, my taga-salo ng random thoughts ko, and siyempre, my Engr. Micah Jezra,

I'm not good with words, but look, I wrote something for u kasi ikaw na baga yan HAHAHAHA.

Well, kidding aside, I wrote this to let u know how proud I am of u for showing up, for taking that test despite everything you've been through, the efforts, sacrifices, and ur silent cries.

We may not get the result that we wanted, but please know na u did great. U did ur best, so don't be too hard on yourself.

        </div>

        <div class="signature">
            Always rooting for you. 🤍
        </div>

    </div>

</div>


<script>

    const correctPassword = "072326";

    function unlockLetter() {

        const enteredPassword =
            document.getElementById("password").value;

        const passwordScreen =
            document.getElementById("passwordScreen");

        const letterScreen =
            document.getElementById("letterScreen");

        const error =
            document.getElementById("error");

        if (enteredPassword === correctPassword) {

            passwordScreen.style.display = "none";
            letterScreen.style.display = "block";

            window.scrollTo({
                top: 0,
                behavior: "smooth"
            });

        } else {

            error.style.display = "block";

            document.getElementById("password").value = "";

        }
    }

</script>

</body>
</html>
